{"id":"vod_jy_116332","vodId":"116332","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"白猫Project ZERO CHRONICLE","name_cn":"白猫Project ZERO CHRONICLE","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/a37d2fc7077b5f0d0eb082e7168654c0.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，位于天空的白之王国和位于地上的黑之王国，一边保持着〈均衡〉一边进行着〈循环〉。但在某一时刻，强大的暗之王出现了。暗之王在侵略白之王国的同时，为了讨伐眼中钉巴尔而提议结下盟约。光之王艾莉丝，相信了使者阿德尔所说的盼望〈均衡〉的言语而结盟。即使在遭到阿德尔袭击之后，艾莉丝仍然相信斩杀了阿德尔的暗之王子，并立下一同为世界带来和平的〈约定〉。但两人的〈约定〉却遭到暗之王的践踏。不只是白，就连黑也企图毁灭的暗之王。发觉这一点的暗之王子，在地底发出哀叹之后，得到了飞越天空的力量，前往艾莉丝所在之处。暗之","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-07-27 00:30:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bW6QrgWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dR6Pm2Ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dBBPAKxd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av28yXVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dL9vOMge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e9rDoxPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e1wGOx3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e31ygorb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bmZYmLpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e73pmNwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkRrk9xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dNkYgZLe/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:58:19.066Z"}